  (text "ESP32-C3 Super Mini carrier for the BC-250 (serial_led_controller)."
    (at 20.32 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e6bcf200-a981-4589-b426-2c56e9bf0387")
  )
  (text "The Super Mini brings its own USB-C, 3.3 V regulator, BOOT/RESET buttons and GPIO8 LED."
    (at 20.32 24.13 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "93b94879-d2c3-4a11-b89f-fdcf4eecab41")
  )
  (text "U1 is not soldered: it plugs, pins down, into the 1x8 sockets J12 (left column) and J13 (right), USB-C at the board edge."
    (at 20.32 46.99 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "4cb19a8d-c22a-41b0-ad17-5651342abd64")
  )
  (text "Its USB VBUS is tied to the 5V pin: cut the red wire in the USB cable (README, Power switch)."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "23b6a619-3ba0-45e9-a847-8d1fc4af4d68")
  )
  (text "The switch common (J9 pin 4) is a real GND: power_switch.pins.button_gnd is null in the config."
    (at 20.32 31.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "0bb5f692-7c9f-48e5-9a6e-70339d735ac3")
  )
  (text "Fan header pin 1 = GND, 2 = +12 V, 3 = tach (unused), 4 = PWM. FAN1..4 = GPIO 5, 6, 7, 10 = fans.header1..4."
    (at 20.32 35.56 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "876a185b-90d3-4a27-abb6-a84fcde225f3")
  )
